WEBVTT

00:34:30.038 --> 00:34:34.079
To to do what you are invited
to do when you get a Nobel,

00:34:34.079 --> 00:34:37.079
which is a lot of talking
and a lot of talking

00:34:37.079 --> 00:34:40.538
and think that you don't know
much about, that's a loss.

00:34:41.121 --> 00:34:46.829
And then if it makes you self-conscious
that everything that you have to do has

00:34:46.829 --> 00:34:49.121
to be important. That's a loss.

00:34:49.413 --> 00:34:51.454
So there are many different ways, I think,

00:34:51.746 --> 00:34:57.913
in which getting a Nobel early is
a bad idea is not the best gift.

00:34:57.954 --> 00:35:03.954
I was at a good age to get it because
I had some years left in my career